= Crosby

Shirley Williams is standing for the SDP in the Crosby by-election, in one of our safest seats in Merseyside.

[? if crosby_lost = 1 : She wins it, overturning a majority of nearly 20,000. The Alliance looks unstoppable. ?][? if crosby_lost = 0 : We hold Crosby, narrowly. The Alliance has peaked, our strategists hope. ?]
